{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "crime_masks",
  "spec": ["crime 7", "crime 17.10"],
  "description": "Test 10 and the type list of 7. Mask parsing: each byte b sets bit (b - 1) mod 32; a byte 0 makes the mask 0xFFFFFFFF; a present but empty array gives 0 (never matches, [quirk]); a missing property gives 0xFFFFFFFF. By hand: [0] -> all; [] -> 0; [1, 3] -> 0x5; [9] -> 0x100; [33] -> shift 32 mod 32 = 0 -> 0x1; missing -> all. The shipped list (14 exemplars in ascending instance order) yields the 7 table: purpose [9,1,2,3,4,6,7,8] -> 0x1EF, [4,2,3] -> 0xE, [4,2] -> 0xA, [3,2] -> 0x6, [1] -> 0x1; wealth [2,1] -> 0x3, [3,2] -> 0x6; zone [1] -> 0x1; condition [3] -> 0x4. Defaults of a bare exemplar: severity 64, arson off, weight 10, masks all. [choice] The display name is the LTEXT string named by 0x8A416B2E when the host has it, else the string property 0xAA12FCB0, else empty. Icons are (0x7AB50E44, 0x1ABE787D, instance) with instance 0 in the shipped model (not in the spec; spec question).",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [[0]], "expect": "0xFFFFFFFF"},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [[]], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [[1, 3]], "expect": 5},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [[9]], "expect": "0x100"},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [[33]], "expect": 1},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [[32]], "expect": "0x80000000"},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [null], "expect": "0xFFFFFFFF"},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "lot_bits", "args": [5, [2, 3], 3], "expect": {"zone": 2, "wealth": 4, "purpose": 2, "condition": 2}},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "lot_bits", "args": [9, null, 6], "expect": {"zone": 4, "wealth": "0x80000000", "purpose": "0x100", "condition": 2}},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "lot_bits", "args": [0, [0, 0], 0], "expect": {"zone": "0x80000000", "wealth": "0x80000000", "purpose": "0x100", "condition": 1}},

    {"op": "crime_create"},
    {"op": "crime_init"},
    {"op": "crime_expect", "state": {"types": [
      {"id": 1, "name": "Generic", "severity": 40, "weight": 0, "arson": false, "zone": "0xFFFFFFFF", "wealth": "0xFFFFFFFF", "purpose": "0xFFFFFFFF", "condition": "0xFFFFFFFF", "icon": ["0x7AB50E44", "0x1ABE787D", 0]},
      {"id": 3, "name": "Fighting", "severity": 60, "weight": 3, "arson": false},
